[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12780.87, "timestamp": "03:33:00", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12789.429, "timestamp": "03:33:09", "text": "在此之前，她和她的家人一樣，都是純素食主義者，這就是她的缺點。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12802.55, "timestamp": "03:33:22", "text": "就像她說的，有一週我嘗試吃素，另一週我就放棄了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12809.429, "timestamp": "03:33:29", "text": "。我當時想，這工作量太大了。  嗯。  所以她就放棄了。我記得我們一起拍過一個視頻，我們在裡面聊了聊在日本吃素的話題"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12811.099, "timestamp": "03:33:31", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/oPgfY_DoKfSXkNAPq8-AgAo"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12835.358, "timestamp": "03:33:55", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/X_zdXMHgJaPa8gTGt4f4Ag"}]